I was sitting around munching on kisses with my girl this weekend,
when, like a good little nethacker, I had the awesome idea that
Hershey's kisses could be included as a food in the game.  Their uses
would be:
Small nutritional value (~20 or so?)
1 turn to eat
Temporarily (~100 or 200 turns) increases charisma (chocolate makes
you happy and improves your breath) by a value depending on B/U/C
status: 2 or 3/1/-1.
As a male, you have the option to offer a hershey to a succubus to
improve or guarantee your chances of a positive effect from the
"encounter".
As a female, incubbi may be generated with a hershey, and may offer
one to you.  If you accept you will end up with an "encounter" that
will have 100% positive effects during the first week of any month,
and normal chances otherwise.
Chatting with foocubi with hersheys in your inventory reduce your
chances that they will have a headache.
I'm sure there's some other things folks could figure out to use
chocolate for in nethack.

